Subject: [PATCH -next] drm/omap: omap_display_timings: Use PTR_ERR_OR_ZERO in hdmi5_core_init()
Date:   Tue, 11 Sep 2018 02:10:55 +0000
Message-ID: <1536631855-47584-1-git-send-email-yuehaibing@huawei.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.8.3.1
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="ISO-8859-1"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
MIME-Version: 1.0
X-Originating-IP: [10.175.113.25]
